<https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/unece-rec28> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "UNECE Recommendation 28: codes for types of means of transport" ;
    dcterms:source <https://unece.org/trade/uncefact/cl-recommendations> ;
    rdfs:comment "UNECE Recommendation 28, Revision 4.2 (2018), built from the official XLS code list (vendored unchanged as Rec28_Rev4.2e_2018.xls). Codes, names and descriptions are copied from the file unchanged; the IRIs are Kairos-minted because UNECE publishes the full list as XLS only. Generated by scripts/build_unece_rec28.py; do not hand-edit." ;
